This is the AROS 64-bit porting of Aliens vs Predator Gold edition.
It still uses SDL v1.2 and is based on the old AROS 32-bit/MorphOS
porting, but it has been updated to the latest version (avp-20170505-a1)
available here https://github.com/dreamer/avp-forever
However very few changes were introduced as well as this version fixes
a couple of issues related to the AROS platform.

AvP requires a copy of the data taken from an original installation
on Windows platform. Three folders (avp_huds, avp_rifs and fastfile)
and one file (language.txt) must be copied inside the folder of the game.
All the folders and files should be in lowercase.

It still has the same limitations of the other forks, such as no joypad,
cd audio and movies supports. It supports some commands via shell:
-v  Display the game version
-f  Run the game fullscreen (selected as default by this porting)
-w  Run the game in a window
-s  Do not access the soundcard

Source code and additional information are available here
https://github.com/sonountaleban/AvP

